# Razor Nahida Xingqiu Diona. ~24s Rotation. Hyperbloom Razor with Diona. Few Shatter occurences. NO > Ins Diona, as she has issues owning reactions in this rotation. DW > NO Diona with GT Nahida. 

# Team - Options listsed by DPS
